# The API image builds from the repo root, because it needs shared/ and
# products/ as well as studio/. Without this file that context is ~1.3 GB and
# the build looks like it has hung before it has done anything at all.
#
# Biggest offenders first.
.git
_other-products
.venv
**/node_modules
**/.next
out

# Caches and editor droppings
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.DS_Store
.cursor
.env

# Not needed to serve the API. The generator reads shared/ogma/fonts and
# shared/ogma/bambu at runtime, and products/dog-bowl/assets for the style
# thumbnails — those stay. Concept sheets and shipped print packages do not.
products/*/design
products/*/design-fonts

# The web app has its own image and its own build context (studio/web).
studio/web

# Test harnesses and docs are for the repo, not the container.
tests
*.md
!products/dog-bowl/AGENTS.md
